<title>USA: Miller cuts acquisitions' price to $17.50.</title>
<headline>Miller cuts acquisitions' price to $17.50.</headline>
<dateline>ATLANTA 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Miller Industries Inc said Tuesday it decided to reduce the price of its recently announced acquisitions to $17.50 a share from $20.425 due the recent decline in the market price of its stock.</p>
<p>It said the change will result in an increase by about 400,000 the number of shares it will issue under the deals.</p>
</text>
